  "subQuests": [
    {
      "subId": "7104201",
      "subQuestName": "Tell Jinwu about what happened",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "710420101"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "710420101": {
            "id": "710420101",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Jinwu",
            "text": "Ah, you're back.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "710420102"
            ]
          },
          "710420102": {
            "id": "710420102",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Jinwu",
            "text": "Hmm, Clitopho? What are you doing here?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "710420103"
            ]
          },
          "710420103": {
            "id": "710420103",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Clitopho",
            "text": "Hehe... Well...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "710420104"
            ]
          },
          "710420104": {
            "id": "710420104",
            "speakerId": 1002,
            "speakerName": "Zhiqiong",
            "text": "You know this guy, Jinwu?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "710420105"
            ]
          },
          "710420105": {
            "id": "710420105",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Jinwu",
            "text": "Yes. He used to sell fake medicines above ground. He'd go around advertising this \"Real Man's Meds\" nonsense, only for the workers to buy it and find that it was just Valberry Jam.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "710420106"
            ]
          },
          "710420106": {
            "id": "710420106",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Jinwu",
            "text": "Well, not that it was harmful, and it was cheap and pretty tasty. It was chilled in ice, too, so it was, all things considered, a way better deal than drinks purchased from a long way off in the city.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "710420107"
            ]
          },
          "710420107": {
            "id": "710420107",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Jinwu",
            "text": "So, you've fallen in with the Treasure Hoarders in the meantime, have you?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "710420108"
            ]
          },
          "710420108": {
            "id": "710420108",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Clitopho",
            "text": "Um, you could say that... Kind of. Hehe.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "710420109"
            ]
          },
          "710420109": {
            "id": "710420109",
            "speakerId": 1002,
            "speakerName": "Zhiqiong",
            "text": "How did you know that he...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "710420110"
            ]
          },
          "710420110": {
            "id": "710420110",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Jinwu",
            "text": "Haha! You've got a lot to learn, kiddo. I didn't spend 20-odd years of my life down in these mines for nothing, you know?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "710420111"
            ]
          },
          "710420111": {
            "id": "710420111",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Jinwu",
            "text": "You can wash the soot off your face, but you can't change the color your hands are dyed.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "710420112"
            ]
          },
          "710420112": {
            "id": "710420112",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Jinwu",
            "text": "Alright then. Tell me, what can you do? We don't feed idlers around here.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "710420119",
              "710420115"
            ]
          },
          "710420119": {
            "id": "710420119",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Jinwu",
            "text": "Well now, guess that alchemy you learned has finally been put to some use, huh? Well, we do need a demolitions team at the moment.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "710420120"
            ]
          },
          "710420120": {
            "id": "710420120",
            "speakerId": 1002,
            "speakerName": "Zhiqiong",
            "text": "Wait. Didn't we get in touch with a demolitions expert from Mondstadt? Why do we need to count on him?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "710420121"
            ]
          },
          "710420121": {
            "id": "710420121",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Jinwu",
            "text": "Oh, you mean her? So, Muning received an apology letter just this morning, saying that the kid had blown the stove right off this restaurant called \"Good Hunter\" and got grounded as a result...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "710420122"
            ]
          },
          "710420122": {
            "id": "710420122",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Jinwu",
            "text": "Even her... guardian, I guess? This guy called the Cavalry Captain, I think. Either way, he got grounded too, and he was supposed to come with her.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "710420123"
            ]
          },
          "710420123": {
            "id": "710420123",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Jinwu",
            "text": "I'm not sure what this is. Maybe it's some kind of code for people in Mondstadt? Either way, she's not coming.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "710420124"
            ]
          },
          "710420124": {
            "id": "710420124",
            "speakerId": 1003,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Um, who might that be...?"
          },
          "710420115": {
            "id": "710420115",
            "speakerId": 1003,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Hahahaha! Really! In what world does that count?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "710420116"
            ]
          },
          "710420116": {
            "id": "710420116",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Jinwu",
            "text": "Of course it doesn't.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "710420117"
            ]
          },
          "710420117": {
            "id": "710420117",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Clitopho",
            "text": "Uh, does making explosives count?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "710420118"
            ]
          },
          "710420118": {
            "id": "710420118",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Jinwu",
            "text": "..."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "7104203",
      "subQuestName": "Look for the two keys to the gunpowder storehouse",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "710420301"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "710420301": {
            "id": "710420301",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Clitopho",
            "text": "How did it go? Did you finish making the Unmoving Essential Oil?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "710420302"
            ]
          },
          "710420302": {
            "id": "710420302",
            "speakerId": 1003,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "We got it! And we took good care of it, too!",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "710420303"
            ]
          },
          "710420303": {
            "id": "710420303",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "Here it is."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "7104202",
      "subQuestName": "Look for the two keys to the gunpowder storehouse",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "710420201"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "710420201": {
            "id": "710420201",
            "speakerId": 1003,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "We've found the cannonballs! They're in perfect shape! How do the fuses look?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "710420202"
            ]
          },
          "710420202": {
            "id": "710420202",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Clitopho",
            "text": "Not great. They can't be used anymore.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "710420203"
            ]
          },
          "710420203": {
            "id": "710420203",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "How did that happen?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "710420204"
            ]
          },
          "710420204": {
            "id": "710420204",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Clitopho",
            "text": "The fuses in here have all been designed such that they are activated by a catalytic reaction with Geo, but the anomalies down here in the mines must have affected them.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "710420205"
            ]
          },
          "710420205": {
            "id": "710420205",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Clitopho",
            "text": "The Geo-catalytic elements within the fuses have all turned into this strange, inert blue crystal, so they're all useless.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "710420206"
            ]
          },
          "710420206": {
            "id": "710420206",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Clitopho",
            "text": "Well, that's not good. We weren't prepared for such strange goings-on.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "710420207"
            ]
          },
          "710420207": {
            "id": "710420207",
            "speakerId": 1003,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Well, there were definitely some words in there that Paimon didn't get at all.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "710420208"
            ]
          },
          "710420208": {
            "id": "710420208",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "So, what happens to the cannonballs without the fuses?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "710420209"
            ]
          },
          "710420209": {
            "id": "710420209",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Clitopho",
            "text": "Uh, that's not a very bright question...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "710420210"
            ]
          },
          "710420210": {
            "id": "710420210",
            "speakerId": 1003,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Eh? What was that again? Paimon couldn't hear you.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "710420211"
            ]
          },
          "710420211": {
            "id": "710420211",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Clitopho",
            "text": "Nothing... Nothing. I'm just saying that without their fuses, none of these cannonballs would explode even if you kicked them around like a ball.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "710420212"
            ]
          },
          "710420212": {
            "id": "710420212",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Clitopho",
            "text": "Because, uh, well. The fuse is what makes the explosive material explode, you know? The fuse reacts with Geo, and then with the contents of the cannonball, and then...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "710420213"
            ]
          },
          "710420213": {
            "id": "710420213",
            "speakerId": 1003,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "And then \"BOOM\"! Right?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "710420214"
            ]
          },
          "710420214": {
            "id": "710420214",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Clitopho",
            "text": "Yes, \"boom.\" But without their fuses, these cannonballs won't explode at all. Ugh, this is going to be tough.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "710420215"
            ]
          },
          "710420215": {
            "id": "710420215",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "Aren't Geo reactions themselves inert?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "710420216"
            ]
          },
          "710420216": {
            "id": "710420216",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Clitopho",
            "text": "Aye, that's basic alchemical knowledge, that is. However, the potential energy within elements can be quite hard to estimate.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "710420217"
            ]
          },
          "710420217": {
            "id": "710420217",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Clitopho",
            "text": "Hmm, for example, if you were to pressurize Geo elemental particles such that they would be densely packed inside a small vessel, an elemental reaction would generate significant explosive force all the same.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "710420218"
            ]
          },
          "710420218": {
            "id": "710420218",
            "speakerId": 1003,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Huh. That reminds Paimon of the curious abilities used by people with Geo Visions.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "710420219"
            ]
          },
          "710420219": {
            "id": "710420219",
            "speakerId": 1003,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Huh. Then where do they hide all the Geo elements they use?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "710420220"
            ]
          },
          "710420220": {
            "id": "710420220",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Clitopho",
            "text": "The principles work differently for elemental users. That's a completely separate matter to how the miners of Liyue make ad-hoc fuses.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "710420221"
            ]
          },
          "710420221": {
            "id": "710420221",
            "speakerId": 1003,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "...You know, how does a Treasure Hoarder from Mondstadt like you know all this stuff better than people from Liyue?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "710420222"
            ]
          },
          "710420222": {
            "id": "710420222",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Clitopho",
            "text": "Hehe, wanna guess?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "710420223"
            ]
          },
          "710420223": {
            "id": "710420223",
            "speakerId": 1003,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Gah! Can we hit this guy already?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "710420225"
            ]
          },
          "710420225": {
            "id": "710420225",
            "speakerId": 1003,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Hey! Paimon's not your dog or something!",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "710420227"
            ]
          },
          "710420227": {
            "id": "710420227",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Clitopho",
            "text": "*cough* Well, if you trust me, I could make a simple fuse here at the Crafting Bench.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "710420228"
            ]
          },
          "710420228": {
            "id": "710420228",
            "speakerId": 1003,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Eh, you know what? It's not that we don't trust you, but you are a Treasure Hoarder, and you're not a miner, either... Who's to say you won't blow us all sky-high?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "710420229"
            ]
          },
          "710420229": {
            "id": "710420229",
            "speakerId": 1003,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "#And even if Paimon does trust you, it's not like {NICKNAME} would...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "710420230"
            ]
          },
          "710420230": {
            "id": "710420230",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "Well, the job's all yours.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "710420231"
            ]
          },
          "710420231": {
            "id": "710420231",
            "speakerId": 1003,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Eh? Didn't Zhiqiong say...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "710420232"
            ]
          },
          "710420232": {
            "id": "710420232",
            "speakerId": 1003,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Alright, alright, stop explaining already! Ugh, what's Paimon going to do about you..."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "7104204",
      "subQuestName": "Go to open the door to the gunpowder storehouse",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "710420401"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "710420401": {
            "id": "710420401",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Clitopho",
            "text": "Huh, alright, that's it, don't shake it... steady now... Alright. Looks like this will do. Now, we just need to insert the fuse into the cannonball.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "710420444"
            ]
          },
          "710420444": {
            "id": "710420444",
            "speakerId": 1004,
            "speakerName": "Black Screen",
            "text": "Clitopho busies himself mounting the fuse onto the cannonball...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "710420402"
            ]
          },
          "710420402": {
            "id": "710420402",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Clitopho",
            "text": "Okay, that should do it. Be careful now, don't bump that thing around everywhere, or things might get lively in here.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "710420403"
            ]
          },
          "710420403": {
            "id": "710420403",
            "speakerId": 1002,
            "speakerName": "Zhiqiong",
            "text": "I'm back with a new map! Go on, have a look!",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "710420404"
            ]
          },
          "710420404": {
            "id": "710420404",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "Thanks for your trouble.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "710420405"
            ]
          },
          "710420405": {
            "id": "710420405",
            "speakerId": 1003,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Nice!",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "710420406"
            ]
          },
          "710420406": {
            "id": "710420406",
            "speakerId": 1002,
            "speakerName": "Zhiqiong",
            "text": "Ah, it was nothing. I'm just glad to be able to help. How are things on your end? Did you find the cannonballs?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "710420407"
            ]
          },
          "710420407": {
            "id": "710420407",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Clitopho",
            "text": "Hey, careful! This one's got a fuse in it already. If you move it around too much, we're all gonna be done for!",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "710420408"
            ]
          },
          "710420408": {
            "id": "710420408",
            "speakerId": 1002,
            "speakerName": "Zhiqiong",
            "text": "Hey, hey, hey! When did you start putting on airs?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "710420409"
            ]
          },
          "710420409": {
            "id": "710420409",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Clitopho",
            "text": "If you were the one holding the bomb, you'd sound pretty brave too, I'll bet.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "710420410"
            ]
          },
          "710420410": {
            "id": "710420410",
            "speakerId": 1002,
            "speakerName": "Zhiqiong",
            "text": "Is that a threat? Have you stopped hiding your true Treasure Hoarder colors already? Well? Gonna blow us up now?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "710420411"
            ]
          },
          "710420411": {
            "id": "710420411",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Clitopho",
            "text": "Come on, I've said this before: bombs are indiscriminate. You go on like this, and I don't think it'll matter whether *I* want to blow you up or not.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "710420412"
            ]
          },
          "710420412": {
            "id": "710420412",
            "speakerId": 1002,
            "speakerName": "Zhiqiong",
            "text": "Hmph. It's not like I can read your mind or something. Who knows what thoughts you're having in that mind of yours?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "710420413"
            ]
          },
          "710420413": {
            "id": "710420413",
            "speakerId": 1002,
            "speakerName": "Zhiqiong",
            "text": "You Treasure Hoarders are all the same. Criminal minds with criminal mindsets. And now you've even got the bomb with you. Great, huh?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "710420414"
            ]
          },
          "710420414": {
            "id": "710420414",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Clitopho",
            "text": "And what of that? If it was in your hands, you'd have blown us up 30 times by now!",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "710420417"
            ]
          },
          "710420417": {
            "id": "710420417",
            "speakerId": 1002,
            "speakerName": "Zhiqiong",
            "text": "...Sorry. I just don't trust this Treasure Hoarder.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "710420418"
            ]
          },
          "710420418": {
            "id": "710420418",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Clitopho",
            "text": "That works for me. I can barely respect someone who jumps at every shadow she sees, either.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "710420419"
            ]
          },
          "710420419": {
            "id": "710420419",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "Hey, are you two even listening!?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "710420420"
            ]
          },
          "710420420": {
            "id": "710420420",
            "speakerId": 1002,
            "speakerName": "Zhiqiong",
            "text": "...Okay, okay.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "710420421"
            ]
          },
          "710420421": {
            "id": "710420421",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Clitopho",
            "text": "Alright, go ahead.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "710420422"
            ]
          },
          "710420422": {
            "id": "710420422",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "So, I'm not asking you two to trust each other or anything...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "710420423"
            ]
          },
          "710420423": {
            "id": "710420423",
            "speakerId": 1002,
            "speakerName": "Zhiqiong",
            "text": "I know, but he..."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "7104205",
      "subQuestName": "Look for a cannonball",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "710420501"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "710420501": {
            "id": "710420501",
            "speakerId": 1002,
            "speakerName": "Zhiqiong",
            "text": "Look! We've done it!",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "710420502"
            ]
          },
          "710420502": {
            "id": "710420502",
            "speakerId": 1003,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Awesome! Bullseye!",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "710420505"
            ]
          },
          "710420505": {
            "id": "710420505",
            "speakerId": 1002,
            "speakerName": "Zhiqiong",
            "text": "Looks like that Clitopho does know what he's talking about after all. Guess we blamed him unjustly..."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "7104206",
      "subQuestName": "Bring the cannonball back to the camp",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [],
        "dialogs": {}
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "7104207",
      "subQuestName": "Make 3 Special Unmoving Essential Oils",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "710420701"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "710420701": {
            "id": "710420701",
            "speakerId": 1002,
            "speakerName": "Zhiqiong",
            "text": "Phew... Thanks. Those monsters were just too much... I've never seen them before, either. Where did they come from?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "710420702"
            ]
          },
          "710420702": {
            "id": "710420702",
            "speakerId": 1003,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "#Whoa, how are you more tired than we are? {NICKNAME} was doing all the fighting, really.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "710420705"
            ]
          },
          "710420705": {
            "id": "710420705",
            "speakerId": 1002,
            "speakerName": "Zhiqiong",
            "text": "Sorry for... being a burden... I'll be fine. Just need to... get some rest over here. The air though, it's... kinda thin. Chest feels kinda... tight.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "710420706"
            ]
          },
          "710420706": {
            "id": "710420706",
            "speakerId": 1003,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Ugh, look at you. Even Paimon's starting to feel a bit uncomfortable now.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "710420707"
            ]
          },
          "710420707": {
            "id": "710420707",
            "speakerId": 1002,
            "speakerName": "Zhiqiong",
            "text": "It's fine... Let's go ahead and have a look at... those devices. I saw some spots of light floating coming to rest on those cliffs above... It's almost like they're... alive...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "710420708"
            ]
          },
          "710420708": {
            "id": "710420708",
            "speakerId": 1003,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Um... You'd best just rest here for now. We'll go alone! And don't collapse on us here, okay?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "710420709"
            ]
          },
          "710420709": {
            "id": "710420709",
            "speakerId": 1003,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "#Let's go investigate those spots of light, shall we, {NICKNAME}?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "710420710"
            ]
          },
          "710420710": {
            "id": "710420710",
            "speakerId": 1003,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Paimon gets a feeling that they might be the key to reactivating those devices..."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "7104208",
      "subQuestName": "Give the Special Unmoving Essential Oils to Clitopho",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "710420801"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "710420801": {
            "id": "710420801",
            "speakerId": 1002,
            "speakerName": "Zhiqiong",
            "text": "*cough* *cough* *panting*",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "710420802"
            ]
          },
          "710420802": {
            "id": "710420802",
            "speakerId": 1002,
            "speakerName": "Zhiqiong",
            "text": "Phew...! That's better! Much better! The air... *cough* suddenly got a whole lot cleaner!",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "710420803"
            ]
          },
          "710420803": {
            "id": "710420803",
            "speakerId": 1002,
            "speakerName": "Zhiqiong",
            "text": "That thing... flew away, and blasted a path open for us?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "710420804"
            ]
          },
          "710420804": {
            "id": "710420804",
            "speakerId": 1003,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Whoa, you scared us! It's almost like you had a case of \"terminal acidity.\"",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "710420807"
            ]
          },
          "710420807": {
            "id": "710420807",
            "speakerId": 1003,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Oh yeah, sure, just focus on Paimon and stuff!",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "710420808"
            ]
          },
          "710420808": {
            "id": "710420808",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "By the way, \"terminal lucidity\" is not used this way!",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "710420809"
            ]
          },
          "710420809": {
            "id": "710420809",
            "speakerId": 1003,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Shouldn't we be more concerned about Zhiqiong?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "710420810"
            ]
          },
          "710420810": {
            "id": "710420810",
            "speakerId": 1002,
            "speakerName": "Zhiqiong",
            "text": "Haha, I'm fine now. I was just suffering from maladjustment a moment ago, so I might have looked pretty frightening. But I'm fine now. Please don't worry.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "710420811"
            ]
          },
          "710420811": {
            "id": "710420811",
            "speakerId": 1002,
            "speakerName": "Zhiqiong",
            "text": "It's like how people might feel faint due to the thinned air if they climb a very high mountain for the first time, or find it hard to breathe in deep waters.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "710420812"
            ]
          },
          "710420812": {
            "id": "710420812",
            "speakerId": 1002,
            "speakerName": "Zhiqiong",
            "text": "These are all small problems — things every good adventurer must overcome. No problem at all, really.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "710420813"
            ]
          },
          "710420813": {
            "id": "710420813",
            "speakerId": 1003,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Small problems, says the person who talks about them so dramatically."
          }
        }
      }
    },
